item.description:
Act 2 Players proudly presents Disney's The Little Mermaid - the inaugural production of a new community theatre company! Join them under the sea for this beloved family musical. PERFORMANCES:

  * Thursday, November 19, 2026 at 8:00 PM;
  * Friday, November 20, 2026 at 8:00 PM;
  * Saturday, November 21, 2026 at 2:00 PM (Relaxed Performance);
  * Saturday, November 21, 2026 at 7:30 PM;
  * Sunday, November 22, 2026 at 2:00 PM (Relaxed Performance).

TICKETS: $40 CAD flat, General Admission. Buy tickets via the event website link above.

GOOD TO KNOW: The weekend matinees are Relaxed Performances. The venue is fully accessible. Approximate runtime: 2.5 hours. All ages welcome.

CONTACT: Olivia Nieuwland, Co-Founder, Act 2 Players - act2playersto@gmail.com mailto:act2playersto@gmail.com - 647-963-8461 - act2playersto.wixsite.com/my-site-1 https://act2playersto.wixsite.com/my-site-1

Source: St. Lawrence Neighbourhood Association

